					{
						m_id = 1511950511
					}
					m_sNote = ""
					m_commentText = "Here's how to check the 'movement speed' of an animation from the point of virew ofthe engine — that is to say, after it has extracted root motion.\n\nIn ModelDoc, click the fourth icon from the left in the viewport ('Hud Display'), then tick 'Animation Info\". Then, play back a movement animation.Then, look at the 'Average Velocity' values! It's these values that I then wrote (manually...) in the 2D Blendspace nodes."
